WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.180
Our hand tracking technique
uses only a webcam

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.980
and a colored glove made of
a stretchy lycra or swimsuit

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:08.480
material.

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:16.510
We can track the 3D pose and
configuration of the hand.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:19.622
Our system is low latency and
can track the fast 3D motion

00:00:19.622 --> 00:00:20.330
of this sequence.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:27.240
Here, we show a prototype
of a desktop virtual reality

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.250
application.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.070
The user can pick up blocks,
move them, rotate them,

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.910
and stack them all in 3D.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.810
Here, we demonstrate a
more complicated example

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:42.240
using both hands,
where we explore

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.130
and virtually disassemble the
components of a disk break.

